From 350d1fb9204b13c5f95e511e98b8bcb47574d425 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joshua Crofts <joshua.crofts1@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 19:32:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10680/15333] iio: dac: mcp47a1: add support for new device

The Microchip MCP47A1 is a 6-bit volatile Digital-to-Analog converter
which communicates via I2C.

Signed-off-by: Joshua Crofts <joshua.crofts1@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Cameron <jonathan.cameron@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
